00:11:54,613 --> 00:12:04,940
And people have mentioned, John talked about this, yeah, this is an election that puts America at a moral crossroads.
人们提到，约翰谈到了这一点，是的，这是一场将美国置于道德十字路口的选举。

125
00:12:06,418 --> 00:12:11,280
Um I still view America as the good guys around the world.
嗯，我仍然认为美国是世界上的好人。

126
00:12:11,860 --> 00:12:18,520
I still think our direction and our future stands with democracies and the people of Ukraine,
我仍然认为我们的方向和未来与民主国家和乌克兰人民站在一起，

127
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:21,020
Not a butcher like Vladimir Putin.
不是弗拉基米尔·普京那样的屠夫。

128
00:12:24,350 --> 00:12:29,010
I still believe we are a country, the wealthiest country in the world,
我仍然相信我们是一个国家，世界上最富有的国家，

129
00:12:29,439 --> 00:12:37,690
And it is a sin in America today after these snap cuts that 50% of our families with kids at least have one day
在今天的美国，在经历了这些突然的削减之后，我们 50% 有孩子的家庭至少有一天会度过这一天，这是一种罪恶

130
00:12:37,690 --> 00:12:39,372
A week where they're food insecure.
他们粮食不安全的一周。

131
00:12:39,372 --> 00:12:41,090
We are America, we're better than this.
我们是美国，我们比这更好。

132
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:52,453
We are a country where we should and must care about human rights around the world and human rights here in our country.
我们是一个应该而且必须关心世界各地和我国境内人权的国家。

133
00:12:52,453 --> 00:13:00,950
We are stronger with a diverse country and an inclusive country, a country that guarantees everyone the same kind of fair shot that I Got.
拥有一个多元化的国家和一个包容性的国家，我们会变得更加强大，这个国家保证每个人都享有与我一样的公平机会得到了。

134
00:13:01,850 --> 00:13:04,530
We all know we have to make life more affordable.
我们都知道我们必须让生活变得更加实惠。

135
00:13:05,810 --> 00:13:09,790
We have to build more housing so the whole notion of that first home,
我们必须建造更多的住房，所以第一个家的整个概念，

136
00:13:09,990 --> 00:13:12,090
You don't have to wait till you're 41 years old.
你不必等到41岁。

137
00:13:12,939 --> 00:13:17,490
And I tell you as someone who I believe the health care system failed my daughter,
我告诉你，作为一个我相信医疗保健系统辜负了我女儿的人，

138
00:13:17,770 --> 00:13:21,870
I am committed, it is time to bring universal health care to America.
我承诺，现在是为美国带来全民医疗保健的时候了。

139
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:33,320
And let me quickly add before you all think, "Oh my God, Warner's going lefty at the end."
让我在大家想到之前快速补充一下：“天哪，华纳最后变成了左撇子。”

140
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:40,730
No, that's not just morally right, it is the only way we'll drive down costs and make health care affordable.
不，这不仅在道德上是正确的，而且是我们降低成本并使医疗保健负担得起的唯一方法。

141
00:13:42,013 --> 00:13:56,420
And while this should not have even been an issue, you know, I've been on frantic beyond belief that um this president or his
虽然这根本不应该是一个问题，但你知道，我一直疯狂得难以置信，嗯这位总统或他的总统

142
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:58,880
Allies might try to interfere in free and fair elections.
盟友可能会试图干预自由公正的选举。

143
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:02,740
So far it doesn't seem like that has taken place.
到目前为止，这似乎还没有发生。

144
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:07,000
God bless because we are turning out in numbers that is going to be too big to rig.
上帝保佑，因为我们的产出数量太大，无法进行操纵。

145
00:14:12,650 --> 00:14:16,331
But we still have to stay vigilant.
但我们仍要保持警惕。

