We have to stay vigilant over the coming days and weeks as these new members get added to Congress.
随着这些新成员加入国会，我们必须在未来几天和几周内保持警惕。

147
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:28,430
We have to recognize as well that the strength of our country has been that we respect rule of law.
我们还必须认识到，我们国家的力量在于我们尊重法治。

148
00:14:29,310 --> 00:14:37,045
And we should never ever again accept the levels of corruption and graft that has taken place in this administration.
我们永远不应该再接受本届政府所发生的腐败和贪污程度。

149
00:14:41,540 --> 00:14:43,680
And we have to protect our democracy.
我们必须保护我们的民主。

150
00:14:45,380 --> 00:14:50,340
You know, I want to make it clear to every Virginian, whether you voted for me or not,
你知道，我想向每个弗吉尼亚人说清楚，无论你是否投票给我，

151
00:14:50,930 --> 00:14:52,100
I work for you.
我为你工作。

152
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:58,093
And I am willing to work with anyone of any political stripe, Democrat,
我愿意与任何政治派别的人合作，民主党，

153
00:14:58,093 --> 00:15:00,500
Republican, Independent, Libertarian, Vegetarian.
共和党、独立、自由主义者、素食主义者。

154
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:08,993
If you've got good ideas on how we ought to move this country and our Commonwealth forward,
如果您对我们应该如何推动这个国家和本州前进有好的想法，

155
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:17,650
You know, 30 years ago I ran because I thought Virginia could be the example to the rest of the nation.
你知道，30 年前我参加竞选是因为我认为弗吉尼亚州可以成为全国其他地区的榜样。

156
00:15:18,010 --> 00:15:22,050
In many ways, because I was a tech guy, I believed that in a connected world,
在很多方面，因为我是一名技术人员，我相信在一个互联的世界中，

157
00:15:22,450 --> 00:15:26,891
You shouldn't have to leave your hometown to find a world-class job.
你不应该离开家乡才能找到世界一流的工作。

158
00:15:26,891 --> 00:15:34,870
That a kid in Tazewell County, Jeff Mitchell, growing up should have the same opportunities as a kid growing up in Alexandria.
塔兹韦尔县的孩子杰夫·米切尔（Jeff Mitchell）长大后应该拥有与亚历山大长大的孩子相同的机会。

159
00:15:35,430 --> 00:15:41,550
I believed that in 1996 when I lost, I believed that in 2001 when I won,
我相信1996年我输的时候，我相信2001年我赢的时候，

160
00:15:41,550 --> 00:15:47,770
I believed that when I came to the Senate in 2008, and in 2026 when I get hired for my last time,
我相信，当我 2008 年进入参议院时，以及 2026 年我最后一次受聘时，

161
00:15:47,770 --> 00:15:49,150
I still believe that.
我仍然相信这一点。

162
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:55,718
We've got to make sure a fair shot is available to every Virginian and every American,
我们必须确保每个弗吉尼亚人和每个美国人都有公平的机会，

163
00:15:57,181 --> 00:16:04,400
No matter where they live, who they love, who they worship, what their race is,
无论他们住在哪里，他们爱谁，他们崇拜谁，他们是什么种族，

164
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,040
Because that is the genius of America.
因为这就是美国的天才。

165
00:16:08,981 --> 00:16:14,900
You know, this may be This is my last campaign, but this is not the end of the road.
你知道，这可能是我最后一次竞选，但这并不是路的终点。

166
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:24,900
You know, I start tomorrow On the next 7 years, I start tomorrow on making sure this agenda becomes reality.
你知道，我从明天开始，在接下来的 7 年里，我从明天开始，确保这一议程成为现实。

167
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:28,220
I start tomorrow and I said as to some of my friends before,
我明天开始，我之前对我的一些朋友说，

